---
# One dashboard for both sites, on the OVH VPS. Widgets reach each site's LAN
# over the tailnet (the VPS accepts the sites' subnet routes).

# Grafana panels from each site's "System Activity" dashboard
# (monitoring/files/dashboards/system_activity.json). The iframes load Grafana
# by IP: the grafana.<site> names are behind Authelia, whose cookie a browser
# won't send to a frame inside this page.
- System Activity (wil):
    - CPU:
        href: https://grafana.wil.5am.cloud/d/system-activity
        widget:
          type: iframe
          name: cpu-wil
          src: http://10.2.20.30:3000/d-solo/system-activity?panelId=1&theme=dark&hideLogo=true

    - Memory:
        href: https://grafana.wil.5am.cloud/d/system-activity
        widget:
          type: iframe
          name: memory-wil
          src: http://10.2.20.30:3000/d-solo/system-activity?panelId=2&theme=dark&hideLogo=true

    - Network:
        href: https://grafana.wil.5am.cloud/d/system-activity
        widget:
          type: iframe
          name: network-wil
          src: http://10.2.20.30:3000/d-solo/system-activity?panelId=3&theme=dark&hideLogo=true

    - Disk I/O:
        href: https://grafana.wil.5am.cloud/d/system-activity
        widget:
          type: iframe
          name: disk-wil
          src: http://10.2.20.30:3000/d-solo/system-activity?panelId=4&theme=dark&hideLogo=true

